\" height=\\\"150\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/surecontact.svg\\\" class=\\\"has-border-color has-ast-global-color-4-border-color wp-post-image\\\" alt=\\\"Surecontact\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:6px;border-width:1px;aspect-ratio:1;width:100%;height:168px;width:168px;object-fit:contain;\\\"  title=\\\"SureContact\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-sidebar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"website\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Website<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tsurecontact.com\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/automation\\/\\\">Automation<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/community-network\\/\\\">Community \\/ Network<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/recommended\\/\\\">Recommended<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSureContact Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSureContact Support\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-4 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">SureContact<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tSend newsletters, run email automations, manage contacts and track eCommerce revenue from one dashboard, without slowing down your site.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"SureCart + SureContact Integration: Complete Purchase &amp; Revenue Tracking\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/1QguPaX-n3E?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p>It lets you send newsletters, run email automations, manage contacts and track ecommerce revenue from one dashboard, without slowing down your site.<\\/p>\\n<p>Instead of relying on expensive external tools or overloading your WordPress hosting, SureContact keeps execution in the cloud while staying deeply connected to WordPress.<\\/p>\\n<p>With SureContact, you can:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Manage all contacts and customers in one place<\\/li>\\n<li>Automatically sync data from WooCommerce, SureCart and forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Send newsletters and automated emails reliably via your own SMTP<\\/li>\\n<li>Track revenue generated from campaigns and automations<\\/li>\\n<li>Run everything without adding load to your WordPress site<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>You get the simplicity of WordPress with the power and reliability of a modern email marketing platform.<\\/p>\\n<p>That\\u2019s what\\u00a0<strong>SureContact<\\/strong>\\u00a0is built for.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>How SureContact Works<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>SureContact brings email marketing and customer management together without affecting your site speed or adding load to your hosting.<\\/p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Install and activate SureContact<\\/li>\\n<li>Connect your site to your SureContact account<\\/li>\\n<li>Turn on live sync and migrate contacts<\\/li>\\n<li>Add your SMTP details<\\/li>\\n<li>Send your first campaign or automation and watch revenue and engagement update in real time<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><strong>One Dashboard for Contacts, Campaigns and Revenue<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Instead of switching between tools, you can clearly see how contacts, emails and sales connect, making it easier to focus on what actually drives revenue.<\\/p>\\n<p>From SureContact, you can:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>View all customers and subscribers in a single dashboard<\\/li>\\n<li>Automatically sync contacts from WooCommerce, SureCart and Easy Digital Downloads<\\/li>\\n<li>Send email campaigns to your full list or specific segments<\\/li>\\n<li>Build automated follow-up sequences for new customers or to recover abandoned carts<\\/li>\\n<li>Segment contacts by purchases, form submissions, email opens and tags<\\/li>\\n<li>Track revenue tied to each campaign and automation<\\/li>\\n<li>Use readymade or AI-generated templates for newsletters and launches<\\/li>\\n<li>Manage multiple brands or client accounts from one workspace<\\/li>\\n<li>Invite team members to collaborate on campaigns<\\/li>\\n<li>Monitor real-time analytics and email performance<\\/li>\\n<li>Export your contact list anytime<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>Everything runs in the cloud, so there is no extra load on your WordPress site.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Email Campaigns, Send When You\\u2019re Ready<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Send as many campaigns as you need. No limits. No throttling.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Schedule newsletters, promotions and announcements from one calendar<\\/li>\\n<li>Segment contacts by purchase history, behavior, or custom tags before sending<\\/li>\\n<li>Turn winning campaigns into reusable templates<\\/li>\\n<li>Use a drag and drop editor that\\u2019s intuitive and fast<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Build Email Automations Without Worrying About Breaks<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Set up simple automations for new customers, abandoned cart users and repeat buyers without leaving WordPress.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Send welcome emails the moment someone signs up or makes a purchase<\\/li>\\n<li>Build post-purchase sequences for reviews or product recommendations<\\/li>\\n<li>Tag contacts based on email opens and website behavior<\\/li>\\n<li>Send timed emails that respond to customer actions<\\/li>\\n<li>Use the AI-powered email creator to generate follow-ups in seconds<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>SMTP and Email Sending, You Control Everything<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Send emails through the SMTP providers you already trust. No per-send charges. No surprise fees.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Connect SendGrid, AWS SES, Mailgun, Gmail, or any SMTP service<\\/li>\\n<li>Use different SMTP providers for different brands or clients<\\/li>\\n<li>Own your sender reputation instead of relying on managed platforms<\\/li>\\n<li>Control sending volume, which can help improve inbox placement<\\/li>\\n<li>Avoid external platforms controlling your email delivery<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>This is a major advantage over managed SMTP solutions that increase costs as your email volume grows.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>A CRM That Cares About Your WordPress Stack<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Automatically sync customers and orders without extra plugins or manual work.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Built-In Integrations<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Commerce and Subscriptions<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SureCart, transactions and subscription status<\\/li>\\n<li>WooCommerce, auto-sync every order and customer<\\/li>\\n<li>Easy Digital Downloads, purchases and product data<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Forms and Lead Capture<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SureForms<\\/li>\\n<li>WPForms<\\/li>\\n<li>Contact Form 7<\\/li>\\n<li>Gravity Forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Elementor Forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Fluent Forms<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Community and Membership<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>FluentCRM<\\/li>\\n<li>SureMembers<\\/li>\\n<li>SureDash<\\/li>\\n<li>Presto Player<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>SureContact Is Perfect For<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Store Owners and Ecommerce Teams<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nIncrease repeat orders with welcome emails, cart recovery, and post-purchase follow-ups tied directly to WooCommerce. More revenue and less manual work.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Creators and Newsletter Writers<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nTurn subscribers into paying customers using campaigns based on signup intent and purchase history. Get automation, not just broadcasts.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Agencies and Multi-Site Managers<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nManage multiple client sites from one login. View all contacts, campaigns, and revenue in one workspace.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Course Creators and Membership Site Owners<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nKeep students engaged with sequences that match their progress, whether they are new, active, or at risk of dropping out.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Solopreneurs and Small Businesses<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nKeep all customer conversations and follow-ups in one place. Simple, focused and easy to use.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Built by Brainstorm Force<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>SureContact is built by the creators of:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Astra, trusted by over 5 million WordPress sites<\\/li>\\n<li>Spectra, modern block-based website builder<\\/li>\\n<li>SureCart, fast-growing ecommerce platform<\\/li>\\n<li>ZipWP, AI website builder for WordPress<\\/li>\\n<li>OttoKit, WordPress automation platform<\\/li>\\n<li>CartFlows, WooCommerce sales funnel builder<\\/li>\\n<li>Sigmize, A\\/B testing and optimization<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>We understand how creators, agencies and ecommerce businesses actually work and use all that knowledge to build SureContact.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Send newsletters, run email automations, manage contacts and track eCommerce revenue from one dashboard, without slowing down your site.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Send newsletters, run email automations, manage contacts and track eCommerce revenue from one dashboard, without slowing down your site.\"},\"description\":\"<p>It lets you send newsletters, run email automations, manage contacts and track ecommerce revenue from one dashboard, without slowing down your site.<\\/p>\\n<p>Instead of relying on expensive external tools or overloading your WordPress hosting, SureContact keeps execution in the cloud while staying deeply connected to WordPress.<\\/p>\\n<p>With SureContact, you can:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Manage all contacts and customers in one place<\\/li>\\n<li>Automatically sync data from WooCommerce, SureCart and forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Send newsletters and automated emails reliably via your own SMTP<\\/li>\\n<li>Track revenue generated from campaigns and automations<\\/li>\\n<li>Run everything without adding load to your WordPress site<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>You get the simplicity of WordPress with the power and reliability of a modern email marketing platform.<\\/p>\\n<p>That\\u2019s what\\u00a0<strong>SureContact<\\/strong>\\u00a0is built for.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>How SureContact Works<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>SureContact brings email marketing and customer management together without affecting your site speed or adding load to your hosting.<\\/p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Install and activate SureContact<\\/li>\\n<li>Connect your site to your SureContact account<\\/li>\\n<li>Turn on live sync and migrate contacts<\\/li>\\n<li>Add your SMTP details<\\/li>\\n<li>Send your first campaign or automation and watch revenue and engagement update in real time<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><strong>One Dashboard for Contacts, Campaigns and Revenue<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Instead of switching between tools, you can clearly see how contacts, emails and sales connect, making it easier to focus on what actually drives revenue.<\\/p>\\n<p>From SureContact, you can:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>View all customers and subscribers in a single dashboard<\\/li>\\n<li>Automatically sync contacts from WooCommerce, SureCart and Easy Digital Downloads<\\/li>\\n<li>Send email campaigns to your full list or specific segments<\\/li>\\n<li>Build automated follow-up sequences for new customers or to recover abandoned carts<\\/li>\\n<li>Segment contacts by purchases, form submissions, email opens and tags<\\/li>\\n<li>Track revenue tied to each campaign and automation<\\/li>\\n<li>Use readymade or AI-generated templates for newsletters and launches<\\/li>\\n<li>Manage multiple brands or client accounts from one workspace<\\/li>\\n<li>Invite team members to collaborate on campaigns<\\/li>\\n<li>Monitor real-time analytics and email performance<\\/li>\\n<li>Export your contact list anytime<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>Everything runs in the cloud, so there is no extra load on your WordPress site.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Email Campaigns, Send When You\\u2019re Ready<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Send as many campaigns as you need. No limits. No throttling.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Schedule newsletters, promotions and announcements from one calendar<\\/li>\\n<li>Segment contacts by purchase history, behavior, or custom tags before sending<\\/li>\\n<li>Turn winning campaigns into reusable templates<\\/li>\\n<li>Use a drag and drop editor that\\u2019s intuitive and fast<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Build Email Automations Without Worrying About Breaks<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Set up simple automations for new customers, abandoned cart users and repeat buyers without leaving WordPress.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Send welcome emails the moment someone signs up or makes a purchase<\\/li>\\n<li>Build post-purchase sequences for reviews or product recommendations<\\/li>\\n<li>Tag contacts based on email opens and website behavior<\\/li>\\n<li>Send timed emails that respond to customer actions<\\/li>\\n<li>Use the AI-powered email creator to generate follow-ups in seconds<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>SMTP and Email Sending, You Control Everything<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Send emails through the SMTP providers you already trust. No per-send charges. No surprise fees.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Connect SendGrid, AWS SES, Mailgun, Gmail, or any SMTP service<\\/li>\\n<li>Use different SMTP providers for different brands or clients<\\/li>\\n<li>Own your sender reputation instead of relying on managed platforms<\\/li>\\n<li>Control sending volume, which can help improve inbox placement<\\/li>\\n<li>Avoid external platforms controlling your email delivery<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>This is a major advantage over managed SMTP solutions that increase costs as your email volume grows.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>A CRM That Cares About Your WordPress Stack<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Automatically sync customers and orders without extra plugins or manual work.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Built-In Integrations<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Commerce and Subscriptions<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SureCart, transactions and subscription status<\\/li>\\n<li>WooCommerce, auto-sync every order and customer<\\/li>\\n<li>Easy Digital Downloads, purchases and product data<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Forms and Lead Capture<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SureForms<\\/li>\\n<li>WPForms<\\/li>\\n<li>Contact Form 7<\\/li>\\n<li>Gravity Forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Elementor Forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Fluent Forms<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Community and Membership<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>FluentCRM<\\/li>\\n<li>SureMembers<\\/li>\\n<li>SureDash<\\/li>\\n<li>Presto Player<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>SureContact Is Perfect For<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Store Owners and Ecommerce Teams<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nIncrease repeat orders with welcome emails, cart recovery, and post-purchase follow-ups tied directly to WooCommerce. More revenue and less manual work.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Creators and Newsletter Writers<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nTurn subscribers into paying customers using campaigns based on signup intent and purchase history. Get automation, not just broadcasts.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Agencies and Multi-Site Managers<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nManage multiple client sites from one login. View all contacts, campaigns, and revenue in one workspace.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Course Creators and Membership Site Owners<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nKeep students engaged with sequences that match their progress, whether they are new, active, or at risk of dropping out.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Solopreneurs and Small Businesses<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nKeep all customer conversations and follow-ups in one place. Simple, focused and easy to use.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Built by Brainstorm Force<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>SureContact is built by the creators of:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Astra, trusted by over 5 million WordPress sites<\\/li>\\n<li>Spectra, modern block-based website builder<\\/li>\\n<li>SureCart, fast-growing ecommerce platform<\\/li>\\n<li>ZipWP, AI website builder for WordPress<\\/li>\\n<li>OttoKit, WordPress automation platform<\\/li>\\n<li>CartFlows, WooCommerce sales funnel builder<\\/li>\\n<li>Sigmize, A\\/B testing and optimization<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>We understand how creators, agencies and ecommerce businesses actually work and use all that knowledge to build SureContact.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p>It lets you send newsletters, run email automations, manage contacts and track ecommerce revenue from one dashboard, without slowing down your site.<\\/p>\\n<p>Instead of relying on expensive external tools or overloading your WordPress hosting, SureContact keeps execution in the cloud while staying deeply connected to WordPress.<\\/p>\\n<p>With SureContact, you can:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Manage all contacts and customers in one place<\\/li>\\n<li>Automatically sync data from WooCommerce, SureCart and forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Send newsletters and automated emails reliably via your own SMTP<\\/li>\\n<li>Track revenue generated from campaigns and automations<\\/li>\\n<li>Run everything without adding load to your WordPress site<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>You get the simplicity of WordPress with the power and reliability of a modern email marketing platform.<\\/p>\\n<p>That\\u2019s what\\u00a0<strong>SureContact<\\/strong>\\u00a0is built for.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>How SureContact Works<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>SureContact brings email marketing and customer management together without affecting your site speed or adding load to your hosting.<\\/p>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Install and activate SureContact<\\/li>\\n<li>Connect your site to your SureContact account<\\/li>\\n<li>Turn on live sync and migrate contacts<\\/li>\\n<li>Add your SMTP details<\\/li>\\n<li>Send your first campaign or automation and watch revenue and engagement update in real time<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><strong>One Dashboard for Contacts, Campaigns and Revenue<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Instead of switching between tools, you can clearly see how contacts, emails and sales connect, making it easier to focus on what actually drives revenue.<\\/p>\\n<p>From SureContact, you can:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>View all customers and subscribers in a single dashboard<\\/li>\\n<li>Automatically sync contacts from WooCommerce, SureCart and Easy Digital Downloads<\\/li>\\n<li>Send email campaigns to your full list or specific segments<\\/li>\\n<li>Build automated follow-up sequences for new customers or to recover abandoned carts<\\/li>\\n<li>Segment contacts by purchases, form submissions, email opens and tags<\\/li>\\n<li>Track revenue tied to each campaign and automation<\\/li>\\n<li>Use readymade or AI-generated templates for newsletters and launches<\\/li>\\n<li>Manage multiple brands or client accounts from one workspace<\\/li>\\n<li>Invite team members to collaborate on campaigns<\\/li>\\n<li>Monitor real-time analytics and email performance<\\/li>\\n<li>Export your contact list anytime<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>Everything runs in the cloud, so there is no extra load on your WordPress site.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Email Campaigns, Send When You\\u2019re Ready<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Send as many campaigns as you need. No limits. No throttling.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Schedule newsletters, promotions and announcements from one calendar<\\/li>\\n<li>Segment contacts by purchase history, behavior, or custom tags before sending<\\/li>\\n<li>Turn winning campaigns into reusable templates<\\/li>\\n<li>Use a drag and drop editor that\\u2019s intuitive and fast<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Build Email Automations Without Worrying About Breaks<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Set up simple automations for new customers, abandoned cart users and repeat buyers without leaving WordPress.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Send welcome emails the moment someone signs up or makes a purchase<\\/li>\\n<li>Build post-purchase sequences for reviews or product recommendations<\\/li>\\n<li>Tag contacts based on email opens and website behavior<\\/li>\\n<li>Send timed emails that respond to customer actions<\\/li>\\n<li>Use the AI-powered email creator to generate follow-ups in seconds<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>SMTP and Email Sending, You Control Everything<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Send emails through the SMTP providers you already trust. No per-send charges. No surprise fees.<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Connect SendGrid, AWS SES, Mailgun, Gmail, or any SMTP service<\\/li>\\n<li>Use different SMTP providers for different brands or clients<\\/li>\\n<li>Own your sender reputation instead of relying on managed platforms<\\/li>\\n<li>Control sending volume, which can help improve inbox placement<\\/li>\\n<li>Avoid external platforms controlling your email delivery<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>This is a major advantage over managed SMTP solutions that increase costs as your email volume grows.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>A CRM That Cares About Your WordPress Stack<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>Automatically sync customers and orders without extra plugins or manual work.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Built-In Integrations<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Commerce and Subscriptions<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SureCart, transactions and subscription status<\\/li>\\n<li>WooCommerce, auto-sync every order and customer<\\/li>\\n<li>Easy Digital Downloads, purchases and product data<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Forms and Lead Capture<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>SureForms<\\/li>\\n<li>WPForms<\\/li>\\n<li>Contact Form 7<\\/li>\\n<li>Gravity Forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Elementor Forms<\\/li>\\n<li>Fluent Forms<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>Community and Membership<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>FluentCRM<\\/li>\\n<li>SureMembers<\\/li>\\n<li>SureDash<\\/li>\\n<li>Presto Player<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p><strong>SureContact Is Perfect For<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Store Owners and Ecommerce Teams<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nIncrease repeat orders with welcome emails, cart recovery, and post-purchase follow-ups tied directly to WooCommerce. More revenue and less manual work.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Creators and Newsletter Writers<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nTurn subscribers into paying customers using campaigns based on signup intent and purchase history. Get automation, not just broadcasts.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Agencies and Multi-Site Managers<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nManage multiple client sites from one login. View all contacts, campaigns, and revenue in one workspace.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Course Creators and Membership Site Owners<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nKeep students engaged with sequences that match their progress, whether they are new, active, or at risk of dropping out.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Solopreneurs and Small Businesses<\\/strong><br \\/>\\nKeep all customer conversations and follow-ups in one place. Simple, focused and easy to use.<\\/p>\\n<p><strong>Built by Brainstorm Force<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<p>SureContact is built by the creators of:<\\/p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Astra, trusted by over 5 million WordPress sites<\\/li>\\n<li>Spectra, modern block-based website builder<\\/li>\\n<li>SureCart, fast-growing ecommerce platform<\\/li>\\n<li>ZipWP, AI website builder for WordPress<\\/li>\\n<li>OttoKit, WordPress automation platform<\\/li>\\n<li>CartFlows, WooCommerce sales funnel builder<\\/li>\\n<li>Sigmize, A\\/B testing and optimization<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p>We understand how creators, agencies and ecommerce businesses actually work and use all that knowledge to build SureContact.<\\/p>\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"surecontact.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"surecontact.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"SureContact Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/docs\\/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"SureContact Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/docs\\/\",\"target\":\"\"}},\"support_link\":{\"title\":\"SureContact Support\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecontact.com\\/contact\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"support_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Support\",\"type\":\"link\"