\"_links\":{\"self\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/integration-type\\/88\",\"targetHints\":{\"allow\":[\"GET\"]}}],\"collection\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/integration-type\"}],\"about\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/taxonomies\\/integration-type\"}],\"wp:post_type\":[{\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-json\\/wp\\/v2\\/integrations?integration-type=88\"}],\"curies\":[{\"name\":\"wp\",\"href\":\"https:\\/\\/api.w.org\\/{rel}\",\"templated\":true}]}}]]}},{\"id\":27458,\"slug\":\"pie-calendar\",\"title\":{\"rendered\":\"Pie Calendar\"},\"content\":{\"rendered\":\"\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-6d65903b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\\\" style=\\\"padding-bottom:60px\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group has-small-font-size wp-container-content-ae2afe63 is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\\\"><figure class=\\\"wp-block-post-featured-image\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"256\\\" height=\\\"256\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/pie-calendar.png\\\" class=\\\"has-border-color has-ast-global-color-4-border-color wp-post-image\\\" alt=\\\"Pie Calendar\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:6px;border-width:1px;aspect-ratio:1;width:100%;height:168px;width:168px;object-fit:contain;\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/pie-calendar.png 256w, https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/pie-calendar-150x150.png 150w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\\\"  title=\\\"Pie Calendar\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-sidebar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"website\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Website<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/piecalendar.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPie Calendar\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/booking-events\\/\\\">Booking &amp; Events<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/docs.piecalendar.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPie Calendar Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/piecalendar.com\\/contact\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tPie Calendar Support\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-11 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">Pie Calendar<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tPie Calendar lets you effortlessly turn any post on your WordPress site into an event, making it visible on a user-friendly front-end calendar.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Add Event Calendar To WordPress In Under 4 Minutes - Pie Calendar Quick Start\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/ncdab1v_B1M?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<h3><strong>The Most Flexible Events Calendar Plugin for WordPress<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Pie Calendar lets you effortlessly turn any post on your WordPress site into an event, making it visible on a user-friendly front-end calendar. It doesn\\u2019t lock you into any post type \\u2013 use the default WordPress posts or pages, or create your own Custom Post Type (CPT).<\\/p>\\n<p>This plugin is crafted with careful thought, ensuring an event management system that\\u2019s lean, powerful, and incredibly flexible. Whether it\\u2019s a page, post, or CPT, any post on your site can be turned into an event and featured on your calendar in a matter of minutes.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Create Events in Record Time<\\/h3>\\n<p>Work directly in the WordPress Editor with existing posts and interfaces you\\u2019re already familiar with.<\\/p>\\n<p>There\\u2019s no external editor or custom interface to learn. In a matter of minutes, you can turn any post into an event on your calendar.<\\/p>\\n<p>Unlike other event calendar plugins that overwhelm you with options and features you\\u2019ll never need, Pie Calendar is intentionally stripped down. Our features let you create an event listing website that is as simple or as complex you need.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Features<\\/h3>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>Turn Any Post Into an Event:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Within minutes, convert any post on your site into an event that appears on your front-end calendar.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Works With Any Post Type or CPT:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Use default WordPress posts or pages, or create your own CPT. Pie Calendar offers you total flexibility.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Single, Multi-day, All Day Events:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Set your events for a single day, span them across multiple days, or enable all-day events.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Multiple Views<\\/strong>: Pick from regular monthly calendar view, week views, list views, or even a single day view.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Custom Field Support<\\/strong>: Already have your own custom fields for Date and Time via Advanced Custom Fields or Meta Box? No problem! Pie Calendar can use custom fields for event date and time.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Pie Calendar lets you effortlessly turn any post on your WordPress site into an event, making it visible on a user-friendly front-end calendar.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Pie Calendar lets you effortlessly turn any post on your WordPress site into an event, making it visible on a user-friendly front-end calendar.\"},\"description\":\"<h3><strong>The Most Flexible Events Calendar Plugin for WordPress<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Pie Calendar lets you effortlessly turn any post on your WordPress site into an event, making it visible on a user-friendly front-end calendar. It doesn\\u2019t lock you into any post type \\u2013 use the default WordPress posts or pages, or create your own Custom Post Type (CPT).<\\/p>\\n<p>This plugin is crafted with careful thought, ensuring an event management system that\\u2019s lean, powerful, and incredibly flexible. Whether it\\u2019s a page, post, or CPT, any post on your site can be turned into an event and featured on your calendar in a matter of minutes.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Create Events in Record Time<\\/h3>\\n<p>Work directly in the WordPress Editor with existing posts and interfaces you\\u2019re already familiar with.<\\/p>\\n<p>There\\u2019s no external editor or custom interface to learn. In a matter of minutes, you can turn any post into an event on your calendar.<\\/p>\\n<p>Unlike other event calendar plugins that overwhelm you with options and features you\\u2019ll never need, Pie Calendar is intentionally stripped down. Our features let you create an event listing website that is as simple or as complex you need.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Features<\\/h3>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>Turn Any Post Into an Event:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Within minutes, convert any post on your site into an event that appears on your front-end calendar.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Works With Any Post Type or CPT:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Use default WordPress posts or pages, or create your own CPT. Pie Calendar offers you total flexibility.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Single, Multi-day, All Day Events:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Set your events for a single day, span them across multiple days, or enable all-day events.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Multiple Views<\\/strong>: Pick from regular monthly calendar view, week views, list views, or even a single day view.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Custom Field Support<\\/strong>: Already have your own custom fields for Date and Time via Advanced Custom Fields or Meta Box? No problem! Pie Calendar can use custom fields for event date and time.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<h3><strong>The Most Flexible Events Calendar Plugin for WordPress<\\/strong><\\/h3>\\n<p>Pie Calendar lets you effortlessly turn any post on your WordPress site into an event, making it visible on a user-friendly front-end calendar. It doesn\\u2019t lock you into any post type \\u2013 use the default WordPress posts or pages, or create your own Custom Post Type (CPT).<\\/p>\\n<p>This plugin is crafted with careful thought, ensuring an event management system that\\u2019s lean, powerful, and incredibly flexible. Whether it\\u2019s a page, post, or CPT, any post on your site can be turned into an event and featured on your calendar in a matter of minutes.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Create Events in Record Time<\\/h3>\\n<p>Work directly in the WordPress Editor with existing posts and interfaces you\\u2019re already familiar with.<\\/p>\\n<p>There\\u2019s no external editor or custom interface to learn. In a matter of minutes, you can turn any post into an event on your calendar.<\\/p>\\n<p>Unlike other event calendar plugins that overwhelm you with options and features you\\u2019ll never need, Pie Calendar is intentionally stripped down. Our features let you create an event listing website that is as simple or as complex you need.<\\/p>\\n<h3>Features<\\/h3>\\n<ol>\\n<li><strong>Turn Any Post Into an Event:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Within minutes, convert any post on your site into an event that appears on your front-end calendar.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Works With Any Post Type or CPT:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Use default WordPress posts or pages, or create your own CPT. Pie Calendar offers you total flexibility.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Single, Multi-day, All Day Events:<\\/strong>\\u00a0Set your events for a single day, span them across multiple days, or enable all-day events.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Multiple Views<\\/strong>: Pick from regular monthly calendar view, week views, list views, or even a single day view.<\\/li>\\n<li><strong>Custom Field Support<\\/strong>: Already have your own custom fields for Date and Time via Advanced Custom Fields or Meta Box? No problem! Pie Calendar can use custom fields for event date and time.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/piecalendar.com\\/#pricing\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/piecalendar.com\\/#pricing\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"Pie Calendar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/piecalendar.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"Pie Calendar\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/piecalendar.com\