div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tLatePoint is a powerful and user-friendly appointment scheduling plugin for WordPress that simplifies booking management for businesses of all sizes.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"LatePoint Review - Is It The Best Booking WordPress Plugin?\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/s5lcrXFWQcw?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p>It offers a variety of features, including an intuitive admin dashboard, responsive design for mobile devices, and seamless integration with Stripe to accept payments. The plugin supports multiple booking methods, such as using shortcodes, block elements, or triggers attached to existing elements, allowing you to customize how bookings are made on your site.<\\/p>\\n<p>The plugin is highly flexible, making it suitable for developers to create custom add-ons and extend its capabilities.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"LatePoint is a powerful and user-friendly appointment scheduling plugin for WordPress that simplifies booking management for businesses of all sizes.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"LatePoint is a powerful and user-friendly appointment scheduling plugin for WordPress that simplifies booking management for businesses of all sizes.\"},\"description\":\"<p>It offers a variety of features, including an intuitive admin dashboard, responsive design for mobile devices, and seamless integration with Stripe to accept payments. The plugin supports multiple booking methods, such as using shortcodes, block elements, or triggers attached to existing elements, allowing you to customize how bookings are made on your site.<\\/p>\\n<p>The plugin is highly flexible, making it suitable for developers to create custom add-ons and extend its capabilities.<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p>It offers a variety of features, including an intuitive admin dashboard, responsive design for mobile devices, and seamless integration with Stripe to accept payments. The plugin supports multiple booking methods, such as using shortcodes, block elements, or triggers attached to existing elements, allowing you to customize how bookings are made on your site.<\\/p>\\n<p>The plugin is highly flexible, making it suitable for developers to create custom add-ons and extend its capabilities.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/latepoint.com\\/pricing\\/\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/latepoint.com\\/pricing\\/\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"LatePoint\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/latepoint.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"LatePoint\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/latepoint.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"LatePoint Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/wpdocs.latepoint.com\\/surecart-addon-setup\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"LatePoint Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/wpdocs.latepoint.com\\/surecart-addon-setup\\/\",\"target\":