\n\\t<h4 class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-[30px] md:text-xl md:leading-8\\\">Overview<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 text-base\\\">Starter Templates\\u00a0is a powerful library of pre-designed templates for WordPress, built to simplify and speed up the website creation process. Whether you are a beginner or a professional, Starter Templates make it easy to create amazing websites in minutes with the tools you already love.<\\/p>\\n<h4 class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-[30px] md:text-xl md:leading-8\\\">How it works<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 text-base\\\">Starter Templates integrates seamlessly with popular page builders like Elementor, Beaver Builder, Gutenberg, and the WordPress Full Site Editor (FSE).<\\/p>\\n<ol class=\\\"my-1 list-decimal pl-6\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"my-1\\\"><strong class=\\\"font-serif text-lg font-medium\\\">Select a Design<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2013 Browse through a wide variety of starter designs for personal, business, blogs, portfolios, and e-commerce websites.<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"my-1\\\"><strong class=\\\"font-serif text-lg font-medium\\\">Customize Your Site<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2013 Import a template with one click and edit it visually using your favorite builder.<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"my-1\\\"><strong class=\\\"font-serif text-lg font-medium\\\">Launch<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2013 Publish your professional-looking website without writing any code.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 text-base\\\">Starter Templates also offer flexibility with free and premium layout options, giving you the choice to use templates that best fit your preferences and budget.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"A collection of free and premium templates to help you easily build professional websites with no design or coding skills required.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"A collecti