vate analytics alternative to website and eCommerce analytics.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>Track purchases and customer journeys for actionable insights into conversions and sales performance. See the complete path to conversion for every customer, including traffic sources and campaign attribution.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate the AnalyticsWP plugin, then enable the SureCart integration from the AnalyticsWP settings page.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Track purchases, optimize customer journeys, and gain insights into conversions and sales performance.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Track purchases, optimize customer journeys, and gain insights into conversions and sales performance.\"},\"description\":\"<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>AnalyticsWP is a simple, lightweight and private analytics alternative to website and eCommerce analytics.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>Track purchases and customer journeys for actionable insights into conversions and sales performance. See the complete path to conversion for every customer, including traffic sources and campaign attribution.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate the AnalyticsWP plugin, then enable the SureCart integration from the AnalyticsWP settings page.<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>AnalyticsWP is a simple, lightweight and private analytics alternative to website and eCommerce analytics.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>Track purchases and customer journeys for actionable insights into conversions and sales performance. See the comp