gration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/design-theme\\/\\\">Design &amp; Theme<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/docs.metabox.io\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMetabox Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/support.metabox.io\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMetabox\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-16 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">Meta Box<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tFeature-rich plugin for creating custom fields and meta boxes in WordPress quickly and efficiently.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Meta Box Getting Started | Meta Box Tutorial\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/M0nEF7b0woU?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Meta Box is a powerful WordPress plugin for creating custom meta boxes and custom fields that works with any post type. It provides a comprehensive API for developers.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with Meta Box to add custom fields to your products and orders. Create custom data structures and enhance your product information with additional fields.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both Meta Box and SureCart plugins. Use the Meta Box API to create custom fields for your SureCart products and customize your e-commerce data structure.<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Feature-rich plugin for creating custom fields and meta boxes in WordPress quickly and efficiently.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Feature-rich plugin for creating custom fields and meta boxes in WordPress quickly and efficiently.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Meta Box is a powerful WordPress plugin for creating custom meta boxes and custom fields that works with any post type. It provides a comprehensive API for developers.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-