ock-group-is-layout-flow\\\"><figure class=\\\"wp-block-post-featured-image\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"1\\\" height=\\\"1\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/12\\/buddyboss.svg\\\" class=\\\"has-border-color has-ast-global-color-4-border-color wp-post-image\\\" alt=\\\"Buddyboss\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:6px;border-width:1px;aspect-ratio:1;width:100%;height:168px;width:168px;object-fit:contain;\\\"  title=\\\"BuddyBoss\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-sidebar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"website\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Website<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.buddyboss.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tbuddyboss.com\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/community-network\\/\\\">Community \\/ Network<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.buddyboss.com\\/resources\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBuddyBoss Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/support.buddyboss.com\\/support\\/home\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tBuddyBoss\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-25 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">BuddyBoss<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tWordPress platform that transforms websites into full-featured social communities with learning features.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>BuddyBoss is a comprehensive platform solution that transforms WordPress into a full-featured social network, learning management system, and community platform.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect BuddyBoss with SureCart to monetize your community features. Sell access to groups, courses, and community features through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When members purchase access through SureCart, they automatically gain entry to their purchased community features, creating a seamless onboarding experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Leverage SureCart&#8217;s powerful features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to grow your community platform.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both BuddyBoss and SureCart plugins. Set up your community features in BuddyBoss, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the BuddyBoss integration and choose which features to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"WordPress platform that transforms websites into full-featured social communities with learning features.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"WordPress platform that transforms websites into full-featured social communities with learning features.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>BuddyBoss is a comprehensive platform solution that transforms WordPress into a full-featured social network, learning management system, and community platform.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect BuddyBoss with SureCart to monetize your community features. Sell access to groups, courses, and community features through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When members purchase access through SureCart, they automatically gain entry to their purchased community features, creating a seamless onboarding experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Leverage SureCart&#8217;s powerful features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to grow your community platform.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both BuddyBoss and SureCart plugins. Set up your community features in BuddyBoss, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the BuddyBoss integration and choose which features to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>BuddyBoss is a comprehensive platform solution that transforms WordPress into a full-featured social network, learning management system, and community platform.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect BuddyBoss with SureCart to monetize your community features. Sell access to groups, courses, and community features through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When members purchase access through SureCart, they automatically gain entry to their purchased community features, creating a seamless onboarding experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Leverage SureCart&#8217;s powerful features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to grow your community platform.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both BuddyBoss and SureCart plugins. Set up your community features in BuddyBoss, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the BuddyBoss integration and choose which features to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p