\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/ottokit.com\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tOttoKit Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/ottokit.com\\/support\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tOttoKit\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-37 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">OttoKit<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tAutomation platform that eliminates manual work by connecting SureCart actions with hundreds of apps.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Getting Started with OttoKit:  Automate, Connect, and Save Time!\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/im1AS07locA?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>OttoKit is a powerful automation platform built in tandem to work with SureCart, allowing you to create sophisticated workflows and integrate with hundreds of popular apps.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>As a native integration, OttoKit seamlessly connects with SureCart to automate your entire business workflow. Trigger actions based on customer purchases, subscription changes, abandoned carts, and more.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with popular tools like email marketing platforms, CRMs, and membership sites. Send personalized emails, update customer records, and manage user access automatically based on SureCart activities.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Build powerful automation workflows without any coding knowledge. Use pre-built templates or create custom workflows that perfectly match your business needs.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both OttoKit and SureCart plugins. Navigate to OttoKit to start creating your automation workflows. Choose from dozens of pre-built SureCart triggers and actions, or create your own custom automation sequences.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Automation platform that eliminates manual work by connecting SureCart actions with hundreds of apps.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Automation platform that eliminates manual work by connecting SureCart actions with hundreds of apps.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>OttoKit is a powerful automation platform built in tandem to work with SureCart, allowing you to create sophisticated workflows and integrate with hundreds of popular apps.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>As a native integration, OttoKit seamlessly connects with SureCart to automate your entire business workflow. Trigger actions based on customer purchases, subscription changes, abandoned carts, and more.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with popular tools like email marketing platforms, CRMs, and membership sites. Send personalized emails, update customer records, and manage user access automatically based on SureCart activities.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Build powerful automation workflows without any coding knowledge. Use pre-built templates or create custom workflows that perfectly match your business needs.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both OttoKit and SureCart plugins. Navigate to OttoKit to start creating your automation workflows. Choose from dozens of pre-built SureCart triggers and actions, or create your own custom automation sequences.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>OttoKit is a powerful automation platform built in tandem to work with SureCart, allowing you to create sophisticated workflows and integrate with hundreds of popular apps.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>As a native integration, OttoKit seamlessly connects with SureCart to automate your entire business workflow. Trigger actions based on customer purchases, subscription changes, abandoned carts, and more.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with popular tools like email marketing platforms, CRMs, and membership sites. Send personalized emails, update customer records, and manage user access automatically based on SureCart activities.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Build powerful automation workflows without any coding knowledge. Use pre-built templates or create custom workflows that perfectly match your business needs.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both OttoKit and SureCart plugins. Navigate to OttoKit to start creating your automation workflows. Choose from dozens of pre-built SureCart triggers and actions, or create your own custom automation sequences.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"ottokit.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/ottokit.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"ottokit.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/ottokit.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":