p>\\n<p>SureDash is an all-in-one community platform that helps you connect, engage, and grow your online community while scaling your business.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureDash with SureCart to monetize your community. Sell memberships, access passes, and exclusive content through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When members purchase access through SureCart, they automatically gain entry to your community spaces and content, creating a seamless member experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Leverage SureCart&#8217;s powerful features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to grow your community business.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both SureDash and SureCart plugins. Set up your customer dashboard in SureDash. Sell memberships, access passes, and exclusive content through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"A powerful all-in-one solution to connect, engage, grow, and scale your community through a centralized platform.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"A powerful all-in-one solution to connect, engage, grow, and scale your community through a centralized platform.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>SureDash is