<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/docs\\/shippo-integration\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tHow to Set Up the Shippo Integration &#8211; SureCart\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/support.goshippo.com\\/hc\\/en-us\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tShippo Support\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-1 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">Shippo<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tConnect your Shippo account to get live carrier rates, purchase shipping labels, and track shipments, right from your SureCart orders.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<h2>Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p>Shippo is SureCart&#8217;s built-in shipping integration for getting live carrier rates, purchasing shipping labels, and tracking shipments, all without leaving the SureCart order screen.<\\/p>\\n<h2>How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p>Once connected, SureCart requests live rates from your Shippo-connected carrier accounts at checkout. From the order&#8217;s Fulfill Item modal, purchase labels and get tracking numbers that sync to both the admin and customer dashboard, across single, multi-shipment, and partial fulfillments, including subscription renewal orders.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p>Enter your Shippo API key under Settings &gt; Shipping. Add carrier accounts in your Shippo dashboard, then create parcel templates in SureCart so live rates can be calculated at checkout.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Connect your Shippo account to get live carrier rates, purchase shipping labels, and track shipments, right from your SureCart orders.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Connect your Shippo account to get live carrier rates, purchase shipping labels, and track shipments, right from your SureCart orders.\"},\"description\":\"<h2>Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p>Shippo is SureCart&#8217;s built-in shipping integration for getting live carrier rates, purchasing shipping labels, and tracking shipments, all without leaving the SureCart order screen.<\\/p>\\n<h2>How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p>Once connected, SureCart requests live rates from your Shippo-connected carrier accounts at checkout. From the order&#8217;s Fulfill Item modal, purchase labels and get tracking numbers that sync to both the admin and customer dashboard, across single, multi-shipment, and partial fulfillments, including subscription renewal orders.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p>Enter your Shippo API key under Settings &gt; Shipping. Add carrier accounts in your Shippo dashboard, then create parcel templates in SureCart so live rates can be calculated at checkout.<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<h2>Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p>Shippo is SureCart&#8217;s built-in shipping integration for getting live carrier rates, purchasing shipping labels, and tracking shipments, all without leaving the SureCart order screen.<\\/p>\\n<h2>How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p>Once connected, SureCart requests live rates from your Shippo-connected carrier accounts at checkout. From the order&#8217;s Fulfill Item modal, purchase labels and get tracking numbers that sync to both the admin and customer dashboard, across single, multi-shipment, and partial fulfillments, including subscription renewal orders.<\\/p>\\n<h2>Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p>Enter your Shippo API key under Settings &gt; Shipping. Add carrier accounts in your Shippo dashboard, then create parcel templates in SureCart so live rates can be calculated at checkout.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"is_pre_installed\":true,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":true},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"goshippo.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/goshippo.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"goshippo.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/goshippo.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"How to Set Up the Shippo Integration - SureCart\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/docs\\/shippo-integration\\/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"How to Set Up the Shippo Integration - SureCart\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/docs\\/shippo-integration\\/\",\"target\":\"\"}},\"support_link\":{\"title\":\"Shippo Support\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/support.goshippo.com\\/hc\\/en-us\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"support_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Support\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"Shippo Support\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/support.goshippo.com\\/hc\\/en-us\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"priority\":\"5\",\"priority_source\":{\"label\":\"Priority\",\"type\":\"number\",\"formatted_value\":\"5\"},\"plugin_slug\":\"\",\"plugin_slug_source\":{\"label\":\"Plugin Slug\",\"typ