ass=\\\"wp-block-group has-small-font-size wp-container-content-ae2afe63 is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\\\"><figure class=\\\"wp-block-post-featured-image\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"256\\\" height=\\\"256\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/WpSmartConsent-Logo.png\\\" class=\\\"has-border-color has-ast-global-color-4-border-color wp-post-image\\\" alt=\\\"WpSmartConsent Logo\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:6px;border-width:1px;aspect-ratio:1;width:100%;height:168px;width:168px;object-fit:contain;\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/WpSmartConsent-Logo.png 256w, https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/06\\/WpSmartConsent-Logo-150x150.png 150w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 256px) 100vw, 256px\\\"  title=\\\"WP Smart Consent\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-sidebar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"website\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Website<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/wpsmartconsent.com\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/compliance\\/\\\">Compliance<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.wpsmartconsent.com\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWP Smart Consent Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.wpsmartconsent.com\\/support\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tWP Smart Consent\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-3 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">WP Smart Consent<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tAdd a GDPR opt-in checkbox at checkout and sync consented contacts to SureContact in real time.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>WP Smart Consent is a GDPR-friendly marketing opt-in for your SureCart checkout and forms that forwards consented contacts to your CRM.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>When a customer ticks the opt-in box at checkout, their contact is forwarded to SureContact and other CRMs once the order is confirmed. Each opt-in is stored with a timestamp and IP, giving you an audit-ready consent log you can export.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate WP Smart Consent. In its dashboard, open Checkout Sources and toggle SureCart on. The opt-in checkbox appears on your checkout right away, with nothing to configure on the SureCart side. Then open CRMs &amp; ESPs, paste your SureContact API key on the SureContact card&#8217;s Connection tab, and pick the list(s) your opted-in contacts should join.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Add a GDPR opt-in checkbox at checkout and sync consented contacts to SureContact in real time.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Add a GDPR opt-in checkbox at checkout and sync consented contacts to SureContact in real time.\"},\"description\":\"<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>WP Smart Consent is a GDPR-friendly marketing opt-in for your SureCart checkout and forms that forwards consented contacts to your CRM.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>When a customer ticks the opt-in box at checkout, their contact is forwarded to SureContact and other CRMs once the order is confirmed. Each opt-in is stored with a timestamp and IP, giving you an audit-ready consent log you can export.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate WP Smart Consent. In its dashboard, open Checkout Sources and toggle SureCart on. The opt-in checkbox appears on your checkout right away, with nothing to configure on the SureCart side. Then open CRMs &amp; ESPs, paste your SureContact API key on the SureContact card&#8217;s Connection tab, and pick the list(s) your opted-in contacts should join.<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>WP Smart Consent is a GDPR-friendly marketing opt-in for your SureCart checkout and forms that forwards consented contacts to your CRM.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>When a customer ticks the opt-in box at checkout, their contact is forwarded to SureContact and other CRMs once the order is confirmed. Each opt-in is stored with a timestamp and IP, giving you an audit-ready consent log you can export.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate WP Smart Consent. In its dashboard, open Checkout Sources and toggle SureCart on. The opt-in checkbox appears on your checkout right away, with nothing to configure on the SureCart side. Then open CRMs &amp; ESPs, paste your SureContact API key on the SureContact card&#8217;s Connection tab, and pick the list(s) your opted-in contacts should join.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/wpsmartconsent.com\\/\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/wpsmartconsent.com\\/\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/wpsmartconsent.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/wpsmartconsent.com\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"WP Smart Consent Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.wpsmartconsent.com\\/docs\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"WP Smart Consent Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.wpsmartconsent.com\\/docs\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"support_link\":{\"title\":\"WP Smart Consent\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.wpsmartconsent.com\\/support\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"support_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Support\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"WP Smart Consent\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.wpsmartconsent.com\\/support\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"priority\":\"8\",\"priority_source\":{\"label\":\"Priority\",\"type\":\"number\",\"formatted_value\":\"8\"},\"plugin_slug\":\"\",\"plugin_slug_source\":{\"label\":\"Plugin Slug\",\"type\":\"text\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"plugin_file\":\"\",\"plugin_file_source\":{\"label\":\"Plugin File\",\"type\":\"text\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"theme_slug\":\"\",\"theme_slug_source\":{\"label\":\"Theme Slug\"