inside viaSocket\\u2019s no-code builder.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Sign up on viaSocket and connect your SureCart account in a few clicks. Then start building automations using our pre-built triggers, actions, and ready-to-use templates &#8211; all without writing any code.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>viaSocket connects SureCart with 1,700+ apps, letting you automate your workflows instantly \\u2014 no code required. With real-time triggers\\/actions and built in templates, it makes your SureCart processes fast, smart, and effortless.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Create automated workflows that trigger from SureCart events like new orders, subscription updates, or refunds. Connect instantly with 1,700+ apps &#8211; including CRMs, email tools, support systems, accounting platforms, and more &#8211; all inside viaSocket\\u2019s no-code builder.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Sign up on viaSocket and connect your SureCart account in a few clicks. Then start building automations using our pre-built triggers, actions, and ready-to-use templates &#8211; all without writing any code.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/viasocket.com\\/\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/viasocket.com\\/\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},