27\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1046\\\">Query Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Visually create complex custom queries without writing SQL.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1109\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">Dynamic Content Widgets<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display custom fields, repeaters, and relational data using intuitive widgets.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1248\\\">Relations Between Data<\\/strong> \\u2013 Connect different post types or users using one-to-one, one-to-many, or many-to-many relationships.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">User Profile Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create user dashboards and front-end profile management pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1443\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1460\\\">Data Stores<\\/strong> \\u2013 Save favorite posts, wishlists, or bookmarked content for users.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1528\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1561\\\">Calendar &amp; Maps Integration<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display dynamic events or locations using integrated calendars and maps.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\" data-end=\\\"1747\\\">JetEngine is a go-to solution for building dynamic and sca