tegration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/design-theme\\/\\\">Design &amp; Theme<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/recommended\\/\\\">Recommended<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/startertemplates.com\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tStarter Templates Doc\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-13 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">Starter Templates<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tA collection of free and premium templates to help you easily build professional websites with no design or coding skills required.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Build Websites Faster With Starter Templates 3.0\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/GX9HR26oYZ4?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<h4 class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-[30px] md:text-xl md:leading-8\\\">Overview<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 text-base\\\">Starter Templates\\u00a0is a powerful library of pre-designed templates for WordPress, built to simplify and speed up the website creation process. Whether you are a beginner or a professional, Starter Templates make it easy to create amazing websites in minutes with the tools you already love.<\\/p>\\n<h4 class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 font-serif text-lg font-medium leading-[30px] md:text-xl md:leading-8\\\">How it works<\\/h4>\\n<p class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 text-base\\\">Starter Templates integrates seamlessly with popular page builders like Elementor, Beaver Builder, Gutenberg, and the WordPress Full Site Editor (FSE).<\\/p>\\n<ol class=\\\"my-1 list-decimal pl-6\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"my-1\\\"><strong class=\\\"font-serif text-lg font-medium\\\">Select a Design<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2013 Browse through a wide variety of starter designs for personal, business, blogs, portfolios, and e-commerce websites.<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"my-1\\\"><strong class=\\\"font-serif text-lg font-medium\\\">Customize Your Site<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2013 Import a template with one click and edit it visually using your favorite builder.<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"my-1\\\"><strong class=\\\"font-serif text-lg font-medium\\\">Launch<\\/strong>\\u00a0\\u2013 Publish your professional-looking website without writing any code.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p class=\\\"mb-1.5 mt-3 text-base\\\">Starter Templates also offer flexibility with free and premium layout options, giving you the choice to use templates that best fit your preferences and budget.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"A collection of free and premium templates to help you easily build professional websites with no design or coding skills required.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"for