>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/memberpress.com\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMemberPress Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/memberpress.com\\/support\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tMemberpress\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-15 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">MemberPress<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tWordPress plugin for creating membership sites, managing subscriptions, and restricting access to premium content.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"MemberPress Reviews: See What Creators Are Saying!\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/MERyR7cZh2I?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>MemberPress is a powerful WordPress membership plugin that helps you build and manage a successful membership site.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>Connect MemberPress with SureCart to provide a seamless membership purchasing experience. Create and manage your memberships in MemberPress, then sell them through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p>When customers purchase your memberships through SureCart, they automatically gain access to their membership level and associated content.<\\/p>\\n<p>Take advantage of SureCart&#8217;s features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to boost your membership sales.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate both MemberPress and SureCart plugins. Create your membership levels in MemberPress, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the MemberPress integration and choose which membership level to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<p class=\\\"wp-block-paragraph\\\"><\\/p>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"WordPress plugin for creating membership sites, managing subscriptions, and restricting access to premium content.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"WordPress plugin for creating membership sites, managing subscriptions, and restricting access to premium content.\"},\"description\":\"<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>MemberPress is a powerful WordPress membership plugin that helps you build and manage a successful membership site.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>Connect MemberPress with SureCart to provide a seamless membership purchasing experience. Create and manage your memberships in MemberPress, then sell them through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p>When customers purchase your memberships through SureCart, they automatically gain access to their membership level and associated content.<\\/p>\\n<p>Take advantage of SureCart&#8217;s features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to boost your membership sales.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate both MemberPress and SureCart plugins. Create your membership levels in MemberPress, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the MemberPress integration and choose which membership level to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p>MemberPress is a powerful WordPress membership plugin that helps you build and manage a successful membership site.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p>Connect MemberPress with SureCart to provide a seamless membership purchasing experience. Create and manage your memberships in MemberPress, then sell them through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p>When customers purchase your memberships through SureCart, they automatically gain access to their membership level and associated content.<\\/p>\\n<p>Take advantage of SureCart&#8217;s features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to boost your membership sales.<\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading has-medium-font-size\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p>Install and activate both MemberPress and SureCart plugins. Create your membership levels in MemberPress, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the MemberPress integration and choose which membership level to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/memberpress.com\\/\",\"a