\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/tutorlms.com\\/support\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tTutorLMS\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-21 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">TutorLMS<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tWordPress LMS that helps educators deliver quality online courses with comprehensive learning tools and features.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Tutor LMS 3.0 \\u2013 The Best LMS Experience on WordPress!\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/78t8LnQjOVs?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>TutorLMS is a complete learning management system for WordPress that makes creating and selling online courses simple and efficient.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect TutorLMS with SureCart to provide a seamless course purchasing experience. Create and manage your courses in TutorLMS, then sell them through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When students purchase your courses through SureCart, they automatically gain access to their purchased content, creating a smooth onboarding experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Take advantage of SureCart&#8217;s features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to boost your course sales.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both TutorLMS and SureCart plugins. Create your courses in TutorLMS, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the TutorLMS integration and choose which course to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"WordPress LMS that helps educators deliver quality online courses with comprehensive learning tools and features.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"WordPress LMS that helps educators deliver quality online courses with comprehensive learning tools and features.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>TutorLMS is a complete learning management system for WordPress that makes creating and selling online courses simple and efficient.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect TutorLMS with SureCart to provide a seamless course purchasing experience. Create and manage your courses in TutorLMS, then sell them through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When students purchase your courses through SureCart, they automatically gain access to their purchased content, creating a smooth onboarding experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Take advantage of SureCart&#8217;s features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to boost your course sales.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both TutorLMS and SureCart plugins. Create your courses in TutorLMS, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the TutorLMS integration and choose which course to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>TutorLMS is a complete learning management system for WordPress that makes creating and selling online courses simple and efficient.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect TutorLMS with SureCart to provide a seamless course purchasing experience. Create and manage your courses in TutorLMS, then sell them through SureCart&#8217;s optimized checkout process.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>When students purchase your courses through SureCart, they automatically gain access to their purchased content, creating a smooth onboarding experience.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Take advantage of SureCart&#8217;s features like multiple payment options, subscription management, and abandoned cart recovery to boost your course sales.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both TutorLMS and SureCart plugins. Create your courses in TutorLMS, then create corresponding products in SureCart. In the SureCart product editor, select the TutorLMS integration and choose which course to associate with your product.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"tutorlms.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/tutorlms.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"tutorlms.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/tutorlms.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"Tutor LMS Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/docs.themeum.com\\/tutor-lms\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"Tutor LMS Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/docs.themeum.com\\/tutor-lms\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"support_link\":{\"title\":\"TutorLMS\",\"url\":\"ht