=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tPowerful WordPress plugin that simplifies A\\/B testing for data-driven website optimization.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Kadence Insights, A\\/B Testing for WordPress | KadenceWP\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/m9fZkuhc-aQ?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Kadence Insights is a powerful WordPress plugin that makes A\\/B testing simple. Test, track, and optimize your page elements directly within WordPress, and see real-time results to make confident decisions that drive higher conversions.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect Kadence Insights with SureCart to track essential e-commerce metrics while maintaining user privacy and GDPR compliance.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Monitor conversion rates, revenue trends, and customer behavior patterns with data that stays on your server.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Get actionable insights about your store&#8217;s performance without relying on third-party tracking services.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:headi