r SureCart products and orders.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Customize WordPress with powerful, professional and intuitive fields. Create custom fields and post types easily.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Customize WordPress with powerful, professional and intuitive fields. Create custom fields and post types easily.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Advanced Custom Fields (ACF) is a powerful tool for customizing WordPress with custom fields and post types. It provides an intuitive interface for creating complex content structures.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with ACF to add custom fields to your products, orders, and customer data. Create rich product descriptions and custom data structures for your e-commerce site.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both ACF and SureCart plugins. Navigate to Custom Fields in your WordPress admin to start creating custom fields for your SureCart products and orders.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Advanced Custom Fields (ACF) is a powerful tool for customizing WordPress with custom fields and post types. It provides an intuitive interface for creating complex content structures.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with ACF to add custom fields to your products, orders, and customer data. Create rich product descriptions and custom data structures for your e-commerce site.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both ACF and SureCart plugins. Navigate to Custom Fields in your WordPress admin to start creating custom fields for your SureCart products and orders.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"advancedcustomfields.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/advancedcustomfields.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"advancedcustomfields.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/advancedcustomfields.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"ACF Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.advancedcustomfields.com\\/resources\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"ACF Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.advancedcustomfields.com\\/resources\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"support_link\":{\"title\":\"Advanced Custom Fields\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/www.advancedcustomfields.com\\/support\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"support_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Support\",\"type\