t.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/12\\/Bit-Integrations-Main-Icon.svg\\\" class=\\\"has-border-color has-ast-global-color-4-border-color wp-post-image\\\" alt=\\\"Bit Integrations Icon\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:6px;border-width:1px;aspect-ratio:1;width:100%;height:168px;width:168px;object-fit:contain;\\\"  title=\\\"Bit Integrations\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-sidebar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"website\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Website<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bit-integrations.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tbit-integrations.com\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/automation\\/\\\">Automation<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/bit-integrations.com\\/wp-docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tbit-integrations.com\\/wp-docs\\/\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"mailto:support@bitapps.pro\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tsupport@bitapps.pro\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-7 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">Bit Integrations<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tAutomate WordPress workflows with 305+ integrations. Use smart triggers, actions, and conditions.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Integrating SureForms with SureCart | Step-by-Step Tutorial | Bit Integrations\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/vLsh3qMXfJM?list=PL7c6CDwwm-ALWAM6nXMfveSjTUUxONz7Y\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Bit Integrations is a no-code WordPress automation plugin. It connects your WordPress tools, CRMs, email platforms, APIs, and external apps. You can build quick workflows that reduce manual tasks and move data across hundreds of integrations, including webhooks for incoming and outgoing data.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Bit Integrations <strong>works in three simple steps<\\/strong>. First, you choose a trigger from any supported plugin to start the workflow. Next, you select an action such as email tools, Google apps, CRMs, marketing services, APIs, or webhook endpoints. Finally, you map the fields, apply conditional logic, set any rules you need, and test your workflow. Bit Integrations then moves the data automatically and keeps everything connected.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate Bit Integrations on your WordPress site. Open the dashboard and choose your trigger. Select an action from the 305+ supported integrations, including API and webhook options. Complete the field mapping and add conditional logic. Test your workflow to start automating tasks right away.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Automate WordPress workflows with 305+ integrations. Use smart triggers, actions, and conditions.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Automate WordPress workflows with 305+ integrations. Use smart triggers, actions, and conditions.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Bit Integrations is a no-code WordPress automation plugin. It connects your WordPress tools, CRMs, email platforms, APIs, and external apps. You can build quick workflows that reduce manual tasks and move data across hundreds of integrations, including webhooks for incoming and outgoing data.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Bit Integrations <strong>works in three simple steps<\\/strong>. First, you choose a trigger from any supported plugin to start the workflow. Next, you select an action such as email tools, Google apps, CRMs, marketing services, APIs, or webhook endpoints. Finally, you map the fields, apply conditional logic, set any rules you need, and test your workflow. Bit Integrations then moves the data automatically and keeps everything connected.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate Bit Integrations on your WordPress site. Open the dashboard and choose your trigger. Select an action from the 305+ supported integrations, including API and webhook options. Complete the field mapping and add conditional logic. Test your workflow to start automating tasks right away.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading --><\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Bit Integrations is a no-code WordPress automation plugin. It connects your WordPress tools, CRMs, email platforms, APIs, and external apps. You can build quick workflows that reduce manual tasks and move data across hundreds of integrations, including webhooks for incoming and outgoing data.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Bit Integrations <strong>works in three simple steps<\\/strong>. First, you choose a trigger from any supported plugin to start the workflow. Next, you select an action such as email tools, Google apps, CRMs, marketing services, APIs, or webhook endpoints. Finally, you map the fields, apply conditional logic, set any rules you need, and test your workflow. Bit Integrations then moves the data automatically and keeps everything connected.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate Bit Integrations on your WordPress site. Open the dashboard and choose your trigger. Select an action from the 305+ supported integrations, including API and webhook options. Complete the field mapping and add conditional logic. Test your workflow to start automating tasks right away.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"l