sks automatically. You can connect form plugins, email tools, CRMs, webhooks, and APIs in one place. It also supports AI actions like content generation, summaries, and analysis.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>You build workflows using a drag-and-drop canvas. Choose a trigger, such as a form submission, a new user, or a schedule. Add actions like sending emails, updating contacts, creating AI content, or sending data to other platforms. Bit Flows handles the execution in the background. It saves time, reduces manual work, and improves your automation process.<\\/p>\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h2>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate Bit Flows on your WordPress site. Open the workflow builder to create your first automation. Select a trigger event. Then add one or more actions and map the required fields. Test the workflow and publish it. Your automation will run instantly when the trigger happens.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"bit-flows.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bit-flows.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"bit-flows.com\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bit-flows.com\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"User Guide\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/bit-flows.com\\/users-guide\\/triggers\\/surecart-integrations\\/\",\"target\":\"_blank\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type