\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/automation\\/\\\">Automation<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/community-network\\/\\\">Community \\/ Network<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/support.omnisend.com\\/en\\/articles\\/10802246-omnisend-for-surecart\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tOmnisend Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/support.omnisend.com\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tOmnisend Support\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">Omnisend<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tIntegrate Omnisend with SureCart to power your store with personalized email &amp; SMS automations, boost conversions, and easily grow your revenue.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"Omnisend Email Marketing Demo for E-commerce: Full Platform Walkthrough\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/SKYu_vDtEqY?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<h4>Supported Features<\\/h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Email and SMS campaigns.<\\/li>\\n<li>Omnisend Signup forms.<\\/li>\\n<li>Other 3rd-party integrations.<\\/li>\\n<li>These Automation workflows: Order Confirmation, Shipping Confirmation, Cancellation Confirmation, Birthday, Welcome email, Contact enters\\/exits segment, Browse Abandonment, Product Abandonment, Abandoned Checkout &amp; Abandoned Cart.<\\/li>\\n<li>Segmentation. Most of the segmentation filters are available.<\\/li>\\n<li>Live activity.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<h4 id=\\\"h_26bf7a6116\\\">Installation Process<\\/h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Log in to your Omnisend account and click &#8220;Connect store&#8221; in the dashboard. Then, choose the platform as the next step. Once selected, copy the API key and head to your WordPress admin.<\\/li>\\n<li>Once in your WordPress admin, make sure you have the SureCart plugin installed along with the Omnisend WordPress plugin and the Omnisend for SureCart Add-On.<\\/li>\\n<li>Proceed to the Omnisend WordPress plugin and paste the API key you copied earlier from Omnisend. Once done, you should see a success message.<\\/li>\\n<li>Then, go back to Omnisend and click &#8220;Check API connection&#8221; under the API key field to finalize the connection from the Omnisend end.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px\\\">That&#8217;s it! You have now connected your SureCart store to Omnisend. You&#8217;ll have an option to add your Brand Assets. After that, you&#8217;ll land on the Dashboard page, meaning the integration has been enabled successfully.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Integrate Omnisend with SureCart to power your store with personalized email & SMS automations, boost conversions, and easily grow your revenue.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Integrate Omnisend with SureCart to power your store with personalized email & SMS automations, boost conversions, and easily grow your revenue.\"},\"description\":\"<h4>Supported Features<\\/h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Email and SMS campaigns.<\\/li>\\n<li>Omnisend Signup forms.<\\/li>\\n<li>Other 3rd-party integrations.<\\/li>\\n<li>These Automation workflows: Order Confirmation, Shipping Confirmation, Cancellation Confirmation, Birthday, Welcome email, Contact enters\\/exits segment, Browse Abandonment, Product Abandonment, Abandoned Checkout &amp; Abandoned Cart.<\\/li>\\n<li>Segmentation. Most of the segmentation filters are available.<\\/li>\\n<li>Live activity.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<h4 id=\\\"h_26bf7a6116\\\">Installation Process<\\/h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Log in to your Omnisend account and click &#8220;Connect store&#8221; in the dashboard. Then, choose the platform as the next step. Once selected, copy the API key and head to your WordPress admin.<\\/li>\\n<li>Once in your WordPress admin, make sure you have the SureCart plugin installed along with the Omnisend WordPress plugin and the Omnisend for SureCart Add-On.<\\/li>\\n<li>Proceed to the Omnisend WordPress plugin and paste the API key you copied earlier from Omnisend. Once done, you should see a success message.<\\/li>\\n<li>Then, go back to Omnisend and click &#8220;Check API connection&#8221; under the API key field to finalize the connection from the Omnisend end.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">That&#8217;s it! You have now connected your SureCart store to Omnisend. You&#8217;ll have an option to add your Brand Assets. After that, you&#8217;ll land on the Dashboard page, meaning the integration has been enabled successfully.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<h4>Supported Features<\\/h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Email and SMS campaigns.<\\/li>\\n<li>Omnisend Signup forms.<\\/li>\\n<li>Other 3rd-party integrations.<\\/li>\\n<li>These Automation workflows: Order Confirmation, Shipping Confirmation, Cancellation Confirmation, Birthday, Welcome email, Contact enters\\/exits segment, Browse Abandonment, Product Abandonment, Abandoned Checkout &amp; Abandoned Cart.<\\/li>\\n<li>Segmentation. Most of the segmentation filters are available.<\\/li>\\n<li>Live activity.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<h4 id=\\\"h_26bf7a6116\\\">Installation Process<\\/h4>\\n<ol>\\n<li>Log in to your Omnisend account and click &#8220;Connect store&#8221; in the dashboard. Then, choose the platform as the next step. Once selected, copy the API key and head to your WordPress admin.<\\/li>\\n<li>Once in your WordPress admin, make sure you have the SureCart plugin installed along with the Omnisend WordPress plugin and the Omnisend for SureCart Add-On.<\\/li>\\n<li>Proceed to the Omnisend WordPress plugin and paste the API key you copied earlier from Omnisend. Once done, you should see a success message.<\\/li>\\n<li>Then, go back to Omnisend and click &#8220;Check API connection&#8221; under the API key field to finalize the connection from the Omnisend end.<\\/li>\\n<\\/ol>\\n<p><span style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\">That&#8217;s it! You have now connected your SureCart store to Omnisend. You&#8217;ll have an option to add your Brand Assets. After that, you&#8217;ll land on the Dashboard page, meaning the integration has been enabled successfully.<\\/span><\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/support.omnisend.com\\/en\\/articles\\/10802246-omnisend-for-surecart\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/support.omnisend.com\\/en\\/articles\\/10802246-omnise