ost-featured-image\\\"><img loading=\\\"lazy\\\" decoding=\\\"async\\\" width=\\\"320\\\" height=\\\"320\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/JetEngine-1.png\\\" class=\\\"has-border-color has-ast-global-color-4-border-color wp-post-image\\\" alt=\\\"JetEngine 1\\\" style=\\\"border-radius:6px;border-width:1px;aspect-ratio:1;width:100%;height:168px;width:168px;object-fit:contain;\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/JetEngine-1.png 320w, https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/JetEngine-1-300x300.png 300w, https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/05\\/JetEngine-1-150x150.png 150w\\\" sizes=\\\"auto, (max-width: 320px) 100vw, 320px\\\"  title=\\\"JetEngine\\\" \\/><\\/figure>\\n\\n\\n<aside class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-sidebar\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"website\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Website<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/plugins\\/jetengine\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tJetEngine\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"integration-types\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Integration Type<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<ul class=\\\"integration-types-list\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/design-theme\\/\\\">Design &amp; Theme<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/knowledge-base\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tJetEngine Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/help-center\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tJetEngine Support\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-10 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">JetEngine<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tWordPress Dynamic Content Plugin for Elementor, Gutenberg, and Bricks.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"How to create Custom Content Types | JetEngine from A to Z course\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/m9lfFsm1NbE?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"138\\\" data-end=\\\"566\\\">JetEngine is a powerful WordPress plugin designed for creating and managing dynamic content with Elementor or Gutenberg. Ideal for building custom listings, directories, user portals, and more, JetEngine makes it easy to create complex data structures without writing code. Whether you&#8217;re a developer or a no-code builder, JetEngine gives you full control over your website\\u2019s dynamic functionality.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"568\\\" data-end=\\\"585\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"568\\\" data-end=\\\"585\\\">Key Features:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"587\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"587\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"589\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"589\\\" data-end=\\\"623\\\">Custom Post Types &amp; Taxonomies<\\/strong> \\u2013 Easily create and manage custom content structures tailored to your site.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"700\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"728\\\">Advanced Custom Fields<\\/strong> \\u2013 Add and display custom meta fields for posts, users, terms, and options pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">Dynamic Listing Grids<\\/strong> \\u2013 Build listings with dynamic data using flexible grid layouts and filters.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"934\\\">Frontend Forms<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create powerful submission forms for post creation, editing, user registration, and more.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1027\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1046\\\">Query Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Visually create complex custom queries without writing SQL.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1109\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">Dynamic Content Widgets<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display custom fields, repeaters, and relational data using intuitive widgets.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1248\\\">Relations Between Data<\\/strong> \\u2013 Connect different post types or users using one-to-one, one-to-many, or many-to-many relationships.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">User Profile Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create user dashboards and front-end profile management pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1443\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1460\\\">Data Stores<\\/strong> \\u2013 Save favorite posts, wishlists, or bookmarked content for users.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1528\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1561\\\">Calendar &amp; Maps Integration<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display dynamic events or locations using integrated calendars and maps.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\" data-end=\\\"1747\\\">JetEngine is a go-to solution for building dynamic and scalable WordPress websites that go beyond the basics.<\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"WordPress Dynamic Content Plugin for Elementor, Gutenberg, and Bricks.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"WordPress Dynamic Content Plugin for Elementor, Gutenberg, and Bricks.\"},\"description\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"138\\\" data-end=\\\"566\\\">JetEngine is a powerful WordPress plugin designed for creating and managing dynamic content with Elementor or Gutenberg. Ideal for building custom listings, directories, user portals, and more, JetEngine makes it easy to create complex data structures without writing code. Whether you&#8217;re a developer or a no-code builder, JetEngine gives you full control over your website\\u2019s dynamic functionality.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"568\\\" data-end=\\\"585\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"568\\\" data-end=\\\"585\\\">Key Features:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"587\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"587\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"589\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"589\\\" data-end=\\\"623\\\">Custom Post Types &amp; Taxonomies<\\/strong> \\u2013 Easily create and manage custom content structures tailored to your site.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"700\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"728\\\">Advanced Custom Fields<\\/strong> \\u2013 Add and display custom meta fields for posts, users, terms, and options pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">Dynamic Listing Grids<\\/strong> \\u2013 Build listings with dynamic data using flexible grid layouts and filters.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"934\\\">Frontend Forms<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create powerful submission forms for post creation, editing, user registration, and more.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1027\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1046\\\">Query Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Visually create complex custom queries without writing SQL.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1109\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">Dynamic Content Widgets<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display custom fields, repeaters, and relational data using intuitive widgets.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1248\\\">Relations Between Data<\\/strong> \\u2013 Connect different post types or users using one-to-one, one-to-many, or many-to-many relationships.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">User Profile Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create user dashboards and front-end profile management pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1443\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1460\\\">Data Stores<\\/strong> \\u2013 Save favorite posts, wishlists, or bookmarked content for users.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1528\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1561\\\">Calendar &amp; Maps Integration<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display dynamic events or locations using integrated calendars and maps.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\" data-end=\\\"1747\\\">JetEngine is a go-to solution for building dynamic and scalable WordPress websites that go beyond the basics.<\\/p>\\n\",\"description_source\":{\"label\":\"Description\",\"type\":\"wysiwyg\",\"formatted_value\":\"<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"138\\\" data-end=\\\"566\\\">JetEngine is a powerful WordPress plugin designed for creating and managing dynamic content with Elementor or Gutenberg. Ideal for building custom listings, directories, user portals, and more, JetEngine makes it easy to create complex data structures without writing code. Whether you&#8217;re a developer or a no-code builder, JetEngine gives you full control over your website\\u2019s dynamic functionality.<\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"568\\\" data-end=\\\"585\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"568\\\" data-end=\\\"585\\\">Key Features:<\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<ul data-start=\\\"587\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"587\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"589\\\" data-end=\\\"699\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"589\\\" data-end=\\\"623\\\">Custom Post Types &amp; Taxonomies<\\/strong> \\u2013 Easily create and manage custom content structures tailored to your site.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"700\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"809\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"702\\\" data-end=\\\"728\\\">Advanced Custom Fields<\\/strong> \\u2013 Add and display custom meta fields for posts, users, terms, and options pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"810\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"913\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"812\\\" data-end=\\\"837\\\">Dynamic Listing Grids<\\/strong> \\u2013 Build listings with dynamic data using flexible grid layouts and filters.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"914\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"1026\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"916\\\" data-end=\\\"934\\\">Frontend Forms<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create powerful submission forms for post creation, editing, user registration, and more.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1027\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1108\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1029\\\" data-end=\\\"1046\\\">Query Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Visually create complex custom queries without writing SQL.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1109\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1219\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1111\\\" data-end=\\\"1138\\\">Dynamic Content Widgets<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display custom fields, repeaters, and relational data using intuitive widgets.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1220\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1350\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1222\\\" data-end=\\\"1248\\\">Relations Between Data<\\/strong> \\u2013 Connect different post types or users using one-to-one, one-to-many, or many-to-many relationships.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1351\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1442\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1353\\\" data-end=\\\"1377\\\">User Profile Builder<\\/strong> \\u2013 Create user dashboards and front-end profile management pages.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1443\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1527\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1445\\\" data-end=\\\"1460\\\">Data Stores<\\/strong> \\u2013 Save favorite posts, wishlists, or bookmarked content for users.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1528\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1636\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1530\\\" data-end=\\\"1561\\\">Calendar &amp; Maps Integration<\\/strong> \\u2013 Display dynamic events or locations using integrated calendars and maps.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1638\\\" data-end=\\\"1747\\\">JetEngine is a go-to solution for building dynamic and scalable WordPress websites that go beyond the basics.<\\/p>\\n\"},\"activation_link\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/pricing\\/\",\"activation_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Activation Link\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/pricing\\/\"},\"is_pre_installed\":false,\"is_pre_installed_source\":{\"label\":\"Is Pre-Installed?\",\"type\":\"true_false\",\"formatted_value\":false},\"download_url\":\"\",\"download_url_source\":{\"label\":\"Download URL\",\"type\":\"url\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"website_link\":{\"title\":\"JetEngine\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/plugins\\/jetengine\\/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"website_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Website Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"JetEngine\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/plugins\\/jetengine\\/\",\"target\":\"\"}},\"docs_link\":{\"title\":\"JetEngine Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/knowledge-base\\/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"docs_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Docs Link\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"JetEngine Docs\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/knowledge-base\\/\",\"target\":\"\"}},\"support_link\":{\"title\":\"JetEngine Support\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/help-center\\/\",\"target\":\"\"},\"support_link_source\":{\"label\":\"Support\",\"type\":\"link\",\"formatted_value\":{\"title\":\"JetEngine Support\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/crocoblock.com\\/help-center\\/\",\"target\":\"\"}},\"priority\":\"6\",\"priority_source\":{\"label\":\"Priority\",\"type\":\"number\",\"formatted_value\":\"6\"},\"plugin_slug\":\"\",\"plugin_slug_source\":{\"label\":\"Plugin Slug\",\"type\":\"text\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"plugin_file\":\"jet-engine\\/jet-engine.php\",\"plugin_file_source\":{\"label\":\"Plugin File\",\"type\":\"text\",\"formatted_value\":\"jet-engine\\/jet-engine.php\"},\"theme_slug\":\"\",\"theme_slug_source\":{\"label\":\"Theme Slug\",\"type\":\"text\",\"formatted_value\":\"\"},\"youtube_embed\":\"<iframe title=\\\"How to create Custom Content Types | JetEngine from A to Z course\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/m9lfFsm1NbE?