:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>All data is stored on your own server, giving you complete control and independence from third-party services.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate Independent Analytics, then enable the SureCart integration in your settings. Your store data will automatically start being tracked with privacy in mind.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Understand store performance with privacy-focused analytics that protect user data integrity.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Understand store performance with privacy-focused analytics that protect user data integrity.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Independent Analytics is a privacy-first analytics solution that gives you complete control over your data while providing powerful insights.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect Independent Analytics with SureCart to track your store metrics while maintaining full data ownership and GDPR compliance.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Get detailed insights into your store&#8217;s performance, including conversion rates, revenue tracking, and customer journey analysis.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>All data is stored on your own server, giving you complete control and independence from third-party services.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\