mbership\\/\\\">Membership<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<li><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/surecart.com\\/integration-type\\/recommended\\/\\\">Recommended<\\/a><\\/li>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/ul>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"docs\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Docs<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/suremembers.com\\/docs\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSureMembers Docs\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\t<div class=\\\"support\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t<dt>Support<\\/dt>\\n\\t\\t\\t<dd>\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t<a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/suremembers.com\\/support\\/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">\\n\\t\\t\\t\\t\\tSureMembers\\t\\t\\t\\t<\\/a>\\n\\t\\t\\t<\\/dd>\\n\\t\\t<\\/div>\\n\\t<\\/aside>\\n<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-group wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3640f9e3 wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\\\"><h1 style=\\\"font-size:40px;line-height:1.1;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:10px\\\" class=\\\"has-link-color wp-elements-38 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-ast-global-color-2-color\\\">SureMembers<\\/h1>\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-summary\\\">\\n\\tCreate and manage membership sites with protected content delivery and exclusive member access control.<\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"alignwide wp-block-surecart-integrations-embed\\\">\\n\\t<iframe loading=\\\"lazy\\\" title=\\\"SureMembers Quickstart Guide - WordPress Membership Plugin\\\" width=\\\"640\\\" height=\\\"360\\\" src=\\\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/embed\\/TTT_y_JRTOI?feature=oembed\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allow=\\\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\\\" referrerpolicy=\\\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\\\" allowfullscreen><\\/iframe><\\/div>\\n\\n\\n\\n<div class=\\\"wp-block-surecart-integrations-description\\\">\\n\\t<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>SureMembers is a powerful WordPress membership plugin that helps you create and manage membership sites, protect content, and deliver exclusive content to your members.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How it works<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Connect SureCart with SureMembers to automatically grant access to protected content when customers purchase memberships. Create tiered access levels and manage member permissions seamlessly. These products were made to work together!<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --> <!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Configure<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>Install and activate both SureMembers and SureCart plugins. Navigate to SureMembers settings to configure access rules and start protecting your content. Add access groups to your products and start selling memberships.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n<\\/div>\\n\",\"protected\":false},\"acf\":{\"summary\":\"Create and manage membership sites with protected content delivery and exclusive member access control.\",\"summary_source\":{\"label\":\"Summary\",\"type\":\"textarea\",\"formatted_value\":\"Create and manage membership sites with protected content delivery and exclusive member access control.\"},\"description\":\"<p><!-- wp:heading {\\\"level\\\":3} --><\\/p>\\n<h3 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Overview<\\/h3>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:heading --> <!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/p>\\n<p>SureMembers is a powerful WordPress membership plugin that helps you create and manage membership sites, protect content, and deliver exclusive content to your members.<\\/p>\\n<p><!-- \\/wp:paragraph 